<main id="main" class="single-form"><h1>Um novo<br>começo.</h1><p>Escolha uma nova senha para voltar ao clube.</p><form class="stack-form" action="<?= e(url('password_update')) ?>" method="post"><?php csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="token" value="<?= e($token??'') ?>"><label for="password">Nova senha<input id="password" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="10" maxlength="72" required></label><p class="field-help">Use pelo menos 10 caracteres.</p><label for="confirm">Confirme a nova senha<input id="confirm" type="password" name="password_confirm" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="10" maxlength="72" required></label><button class="button red">Salvar nova senha <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"/></svg></span></button><a href="<?= e(url('password_forgot')) ?>">Solicitar outro link</a></form></main>
